# Enforce LF line endings in the repo.
#
# This matters more here than in a pure-Linux project: development happens on
# Windows while everything the repo produces runs in a Linux container. A CRLF
# that slips into a shell script or a generated Telegraf config breaks at
# runtime, not at commit time.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.rs   text eol=lf
*.toml text eol=lf
*.conf text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.yml  text eol=lf
*.md   text eol=lf
*.sh   text eol=lf
